adipic.meaningEn:
a. Pertaining to, or derived from, fatty or oily substances;
   -- applied to certain acids obtained from fats by the action of nitric
   acid.

amid.meaningEn:
prep. See Amidst.
prep. In the midst or middle of; surrounded or encompassed by;
   among.

frequent.meaningEn:
v. be a regular or frequent visitor to a certain place
a. coming at short intervals or habitually
s. frequently encountered;

once.meaningEn:
r. on one occasion
r. as soon as
r. at a previous time;
